## Factory, replacement and fixed-limit findings

Exactly79 unique default commands include apply_patch once. Root and
virtual-bash/commands/apply-patch expose the same createApplyPatchCommand,
createApplyPatchCommands and applyPatchCommands functions, plus the two declared
types ApplyPatchCommandsOptions and ApplyPatchLimits. The aggregate option is
